sequenceDiagram
    participant PW as Playwright Test
    participant D as Dev Service
    participant S as Store (memory.py)

    Note over PW: test suite startup
    loop until 200
        PW->>D: GET /health
        D-->>PW: 200 { status: "ok" }
    end

    Note over PW: beforeEach
    PW->>D: POST /api/dev/reset
    D->>S: _articles = deepcopy(SEED_ARTICLES)
    D->>S: _jobs = {}
    D-->>PW: 200 { status: "reset" }
    Note over PW: test executes with 6 clean articles